<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">Ref No: {{{Case.Case_Number__c}}}<br />
<br />
Hi {{{Case.First_Name__c}}},
<p>Thank you for getting in touch with the Qantas Customer Care team about our onboard Wi-Fi service.<br />
<br />
<em><strong>-If not working add: -</strong></em><br />
<br />
<strong>Thing don’t always go to plan</strong><br />
<br />
I’m sorry to hear that our new Wi-Fi service wasn’t available on QF{{{Case.Flight_Number__c}}}, I understand your disappointment.<br />
<br />
When issues arise, our cabin crew explore all avenues to restore the service — from rebooting the system to contacting engineering teams on the ground for advice. However, in some instances, we're unable to fix the problem before landing.<br />
<br />
<em><strong>-If concerns of safety, add:-</strong></em><br />
<br />
<strong>Safety is our number one priority</strong><br />
<br />
When it comes to safety, we never compromise — especially when it comes to the safety of our customers and staff.<br />
<br />
Our in-flight Wi-Fi has been put through its paces, and I wanted to assure you that every piece of equipment on the aircraft has been certified to stringent standards.<br />
<br />
<strong>We value your opinion</strong><br />
<br />
Customer feedback plays an important role in our continuous improvement process so that we can provide you with exceptional service from start to finish.<br />
<br />
I wanted to assure you that I’ve passed your comments onto the relevant team for review.<br />
<br />
Thank you for taking the time to tell us about your experience and we look forward to welcoming you onboard again soon.</p>
</body>
</html>